config BR2_PACKAGE_RCHEEVOS
	bool "rcheevos"
	help
	  RetroAchievements runtime library.

	  Provides the achievement parser, per-frame trigger runtime, console
	  memory mapping and ROM hashing used by the offline achievements
	  support in Phobos. The runtime is built without networking, Lua or
	  threading because the handheld has no network stack.

	  https://github.com/RetroAchievements/rcheevos
